+
+- Four focused Python suites: 107 tests, exit 0.
+- `swift test --filter RelayAssetManifestTests`: four tests, exit 0.
+- `make relay-asset-bundle-check relay-asset-manifest-test`: exit 0; 26 Python and four Swift manifest tests pass.
